---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';

const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL;
const url = (path = '') => `${base}${path.replace(/^\/+/, '')}`;
---

<Layout
  title="About OceanHub | Offshore Decision Intelligence"
  description="OceanHub is building a traceable offshore decision-intelligence product and a forming Green Offshore Technology Alliance around shared capability gaps."
>
  <section class="border-b border-white/10 py-20 md:py-28">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-6 sm:px-8">
      <div class="max-w-4xl reveal">
        <p class="font-mono text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-cyan-300">About OceanHub</p>
        <h1 class="mt-5 font-display text-4xl font-black leading-tight tracking-tight text-white sm:text-6xl">
          Start with the offshore decision. Build the evidence chain around it.
        </h1>
        <p class="mt-6 max-w-3xl text-lg leading-relaxed text-slate-300">
          OceanHub is an emerging offshore decision-intelligence product: it structures real engineering precedents so project teams can trace a decision through uncertainty, evidence, methods, capabilities, deliverables, standards and sources.
        </p>
        <div class="mt-9 flex flex-wrap gap-3">
          <a href={url('scope/')} class="inline-flex rounded-xl bg-cyan-400 px-5 py-3 text-sm font-black text-slate-950 hover:bg-cyan-300">Scope a Project</a>
          <button type="button" data-open-collaboration="partner" class="inline-flex rounded-xl border border-white/15 bg-white/5 px-5 py-3 text-sm font-bold text-white hover:bg-white/10">Present a Capability</button>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="border-b border-white/10 py-20 md:py-24">
    <div class="mx-auto grid max-w-7xl grid-cols-1 gap-12 px-6 sm:px-8 lg:grid-cols-12 lg:gap-16">
      <div class="reveal lg:col-span-5">
        <p class="font-mono text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-slate-500">The problem</p>
        <h2 class="mt-4 font-display text-3xl font-black text-white sm:text-4xl">Offshore evidence crosses organizational and disciplinary boundaries.</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="reveal space-y-5 text-base leading-relaxed text-slate-400 lg:col-span-7" style="transition-delay: 80ms;">
        <p>Storage assurance, offshore-wind foundations, subsea corridors and environmental consenting rely on observations that are usually acquired, interpreted and delivered by different specialist teams.</p>
        <p>The failure mode is not simply “missing technology.” It is a broken handoff between the decision that must be made, the uncertainty that matters, the evidence that can reduce it and the capability that can deliver that evidence.</p>
        <p>OceanHub is designed around that handoff. The long-term asset is a structured case and capability graph, not a larger pile of generic articles or vendor listings.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="border-b border-white/10 py-20 md:py-24">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-6 sm:px-8">
      <div class="reveal max-w-3xl">
        <p class="font-mono text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-cyan-300">Operating model</p>
        <h2 class="mt-4 font-display text-3xl font-black text-white sm:text-4xl">Knowledge → Decision → Network</h2>
      </div>

      <div class="reveal mt-10 divide-y divide-white/10 border-y border-white/10" style="transition-delay: 80ms;">
        {[
          ['01', 'Knowledge layer', 'Encode real offshore cases as traceable relationships between project stage, decision, uncertainty, evidence, method, capability, deliverable, standard and source.'],
          ['02', 'Decision layer', 'Use the Decision Scoper to assemble an evidence plan from validated reference patterns and expose gaps rather than inventing certainty.'],
          ['03', 'Network layer', 'Connect recurring capability gaps to specialist partners and proposed JIPs where collaboration can produce a better shared solution.']
        ].map(([number, title, description]) => (
          <div class="grid grid-cols-[3rem_1fr] gap-4 py-6 sm:grid-cols-[4rem_12rem_1fr] sm:gap-6">
            <span class="font-mono text-xs text-cyan-400">{number}</span>
            <strong class="text-sm text-white">{title}</strong>
            <p class="col-start-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-400 sm:col-start-3">{description}</p>
          </div>
        ))}
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="border-b border-white/10 py-20 md:py-24">
    <div class="mx-auto grid max-w-7xl grid-cols-1 gap-12 px-6 sm:px-8 lg:grid-cols-12 lg:gap-16">
      <div class="reveal lg:col-span-5">
        <p class="font-mono text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-emerald-300">Green Offshore Technology Alliance</p>
        <h2 class="mt-4 font-display text-3xl font-black text-white sm:text-4xl">A collaboration network being built, not a constituted institution being claimed.</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="reveal lg:col-span-7" style="transition-delay: 80ms;">
        <p class="text-base leading-relaxed text-slate-400">
          The alliance is a forming concept motivated by a practical observation: some offshore capability gaps are better solved through shared field evidence, benchmark methods and Joint Industry Projects than through isolated vendor claims.
        </p>
        <div class="mt-7 border-l-2 border-emerald-400/40 pl-5 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-400">
          OceanHub does not present BGP, Peneson or any other organization as a founding member, sponsor or committed JIP participant unless that relationship is explicitly confirmed.
        </div>
        <div class="mt-8 flex flex-wrap gap-3">
          <a href={url('jips/')} class="inline-flex rounded-xl bg-emerald-400 px-5 py-3 text-sm font-black text-slate-950 hover:bg-emerald-300">Explore proposed JIPs</a>
          <button type="button" data-open-collaboration="partner" class="inline-flex rounded-xl border border-emerald-400/30 bg-emerald-500/10 px-5 py-3 text-sm font-bold text-emerald-200 hover:bg-emerald-500/15">Discuss capability fit</button>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="py-20 md:py-24">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-6 sm:px-8">
      <div class="reveal grid grid-cols-1 gap-8 lg:grid-cols-12 lg:items-center">
        <div class="lg:col-span-8">
          <p class="font-mono text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-cyan-300">Two ways in</p>
          <h2 class="mt-3 font-display text-3xl font-black text-white">Bring a decision, or bring a capability.</h2>
          <p class="mt-4 max-w-3xl text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-400">Project teams can start with the Scoper and continue into a structured inquiry. Specialists can show the evidence behind their capability and identify where it fits a proposed workstream.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-3 lg:col-span-4 lg:justify-end">
          <button type="button" data-open-collaboration="project" class="rounded-xl bg-cyan-400 px-5 py-3 text-sm font-black text-slate-950 hover:bg-cyan-300">I have a project</button>
          <button type="button" data-open-collaboration="partner" class="rounded-xl border border-white/15 bg-white/5 px-5 py-3 text-sm font-bold text-white hover:bg-white/10">I have a capability</button>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
